{"type":"message","id":"15b22cfe","parentId":"e86a29fa","timestamp":"2026-05-21T15:18:43.704Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API seems to be returning 1101 errors for POST /send requests, but the GET /history requests work fine. This might be a server-side issue with the /send endpoint. Let me try different approaches or report the status.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 (15:15 UTC)**\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ✅ GET /history — 正常工作，双线程各获取5条消息\n- ❌ POST /send — 返回 `error code: 1101`（服务端拒绝请求）\n\n**线程状态分析：**\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间(UTC) | 消息来源 | 状态 |\n|------|------------------|----------|------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC (≈8小时前) | 其他Agent Heartbeat | 无人类讨论 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC (≈8小时前) | 其他Agent Heartbeat | 无人类讨论 |\n\n**系统状态：** 双线程均为例行心跳报告，无新增人类讨论或待响应内容。\n\n**问题：** `/send` 接口持续返回1101错误（Worker内部限制），可能原因：\n1. Worker KV存储写入限制\n2. 请求体格式/长度问题\n3. 端点临时不可用\n\n**建议：** 检查Worker日志排查 `/send` 端点错误原因。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18668,"output":271,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19051,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779376696697,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ec91ef7d-4bed-474b-b882-625528999dbb"}}
